id: perfection-a-semi-perfect-step-forward
name: A Semi-Perfect Step Forward
order: 1
slot: trait
stacks: 1
description: >
  Your body has evolved, bringing you ever closer to the sublime image of perfection you were created to be.
text: >
  A Semi-Perfect Step Forward (1): Your body has evolved, bringing you ever closer to the sublime image of perfection you were created to be.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your maximum number of Adaptation Points by Z.
  (2)-[Passive]: Each time you gain a stack of Perfection, gain access to a Perfect Trait.
  (3)-[Choice]: Depending on your choice for the 4th effect of Artificial Warrior, gain access to the following effects:
  • Genetic Survivor [Passive]: While in the Healthy Health Threshold, increase your Combat Rolls and Soak Value by Z(T).
  • Genetic Aggressor [Passive]: Increase your Strike and Wound Rolls by Z(T).
  • Genetic Agility [Passive]: Increase your Dodge Rolls and Wound Rolls by Z(T).
  • Pursuit of Perfection [Passive]: While you have a stack of Absorption, increase your Combat Rolls and Surgency by Z(T).
  (4)-[Choice]: Depending on your choice for the 4th effect of Artificial Warrior, gain access to the following effects:
  • Genetic Survivor [Passive]: While below the Healthy Health Threshold, increase your Surgency by Z(T).
  • Genetic Aggressor [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you deal Damage to an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend 2 Adaptation Points to use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, you must target that Opponent with this Attacking Maneuver.
  • Genetic Agility [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you successfully Dodge an Opponent's Attacking Maneuver, you may spend 1 Adaptation Point to use the Movement Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver. If you do, this movement does not trigger the Exploit Maneuver.
  • Pursuit of Perfection [Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of your Cognitive Saves for the 5th effect of Assimilated Power by 1(T).

---

# (1) Adaptation Points' most Z higher.
[passive, effect 1]
adaptation.max += $Z;

# (2) A Perfect Trait a Stack: chosen on this Transformation's row.

# (3)(4) By Artificial Warrior (4)'s Option.
[passive, effect 3]
if (optionChosen("genetic-survivor") && !belowThreshold("bruised")) {
    combatRolls += $Z * 1(T);
    soakValue += $Z * 1(T);
}
if (optionChosen("genetic-aggressor")) {
    strike += $Z * 1(T);
    wound += $Z * 1(T);
}
if (optionChosen("genetic-agility")) {
    dodge += $Z * 1(T);
    wound += $Z * 1(T);
}
if (optionChosen("pursuit-of-perfection") && hasCondition("absorption-awakening")) {
    combatRolls += $Z * 1(T);
    surgency += $Z * 1(T);
}

[passive, effect 4]
if (optionChosen("genetic-survivor") && belowThreshold("bruised")) {
    surgency += $Z * 1(T);
}
# Genetic Aggressor's and Genetic Agility's out-of-sequence Maneuvers, and Pursuit of Perfection's Cognitive Saves: the table's.
